@startuml SIMPLE_ARCHITECTURE
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false

title Bangladesh e-GP Assistant - High-Level Architecture

actor "User / Official" as User
participant "React Frontend\n(Netlify UI)" as UI
participant "FastAPI Service\n(Render / Local)" as API
participant "RAG Engine\n(FAISS + BM25)" as RAG
participant "Knowledge Store\n(v001 Indexes & Images)" as Data
participant "LLM Providers\n(Groq / Gemini / Offline)" as LLM

User -> UI: Ask Question / Upload Screenshot
UI -> API: POST /api/chat
API -> RAG: Query Pipeline
RAG -> Data: Search Vectors, Keywords & Chunks
Data --> RAG: Retrieved Chunks & Image Paths
RAG -> LLM: Grounded Prompt + Evidence
LLM --> API: Structured Synthesized Response
API --> UI: Answer + Citations + Exact Chunk Diagram
UI --> User: Display Formatted Guidance

note right of LLM
  Failover Chain:
  1. Groq (gpt-oss-20b / qwen3.8-27b)
  2. Gemini Flash
  3. Offline Synthesizer
  4. Helpdesk Fallback (16575)
end note

@enduml

